  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ないしょばなしを　することで　あいての\nしゅうちゅうりょくを　うしなわせ\nあいての　とくこうを　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "비밀 이야기를 함으로써\n상대의 집중력을 잃게 하여\n특수공격을 떨어뜨린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dévoile des secrets à l’ennemi qui perd sa\nconcentration et voit son Attaque Spéciale\ndiminuer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender vertraut dem Ziel ein Geheimnis an.\nDadurch stört er dessen Konzentration und senkt\ndessen Spezial-Angriff.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bicicleta plegable con la que se va más rápido\nque corriendo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa svela dei segreti al bersaglio,\ndistraendolo e riducendone l’Attacco Speciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user tells the target a secret, and\nthe target loses its ability to concentrate.\nThis lowers the target’s Sp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ないしょばなしを　することで　相手の\n集中力を　失わせ\n相手の　特攻を　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
